[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2690143133","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103379#issuecomment-2690143133","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103379","id":2690143133,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gWFOd","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T09:23:09Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T09:27:13Z","body":"I can't reproduce this issue, could you check if this happens with Godot 4.4 beta 1 and 4.3 stable? Also, could you add a `print()` in both `set_num1` and `set_num2` to confirm if these two functions are being called?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2690143133/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2869930366","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103379#issuecomment-2869930366","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103379","id":2869930366,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rD6l-","user":{"login":"derula","id":601781,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTc4MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601781?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/derula","html_url":"https://github.com/derula","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derula/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derula/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derula/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derula/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derula/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derula/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-11T15:09:03Z","updated_at":"2025-05-11T15:25:09Z","body":"~~Same problem here, using 4.4.1, I'm writing an `EditorPlugin` to preview a resource in a bottom panel, I implemented the setter with `emit_changed`, and subscribe to changes on `_edit`, but the handler is never called. I also tried subscribing to `EditorInterface.get_inspector().property_edited` and `EditorInterface.get_inspector().edited_object_changed` in `_enable_plugin`, neither seem to be emitted for properties on resources that are properties of nodes in the tree. I have to collapse and expand the property in the inspector every time I want to refresh the preview. Very annoying.~~\n\nEdit: It got fixed for me by reloading the project. Apparently, adding a `@tool` decorator to the resource doesn't get picked up before reloading the project. Which is still confusing, but at least it works now :)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2869930366/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3110470163","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103379#issuecomment-3110470163","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103379","id":3110470163,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65ZgIT","user":{"login":"bazk","id":1514520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTQ1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1514520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazk","html_url":"https://github.com/bazk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-23T21:59:56Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T21:59:56Z","body":"I can confirm, same thing happened to me on 4.4.1.\n\nAdding a `@tool` annotation to a Resource while the Editor is running doesn't seem to take effect until you restart the Editor itself. This was very confusing indeed...","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3110470163/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3585054539","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103379#issuecomment-3585054539","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103379","id":3585054539,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Vr5dL","user":{"login":"ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-27T10:06:26Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T10:06:26Z","body":"This is a known issue, and not a unique behavior of `@tool` scripts that extend resources.\n\nThe [Docs Page for @tool](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.html) has a warning about this:\n\n> You may need to restart the editor. This is a known bug found in all Godot 4 versions: \n\nSee [GH-66381](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/66381) for a more lengthy discussion of the issue, but the BugSquad is aware of this and has confirmed it several times.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.